  "field_opisanie_tovara_1": {
   "value": "<h3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"93\"><strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"91\">Haier AB71S1LG1FA/1U71S1LR1FA – Tijorat binolari uchun kuchli kasseta konditsioneri</strong></h3><p data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"411\"><strong data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"128\">Haier AB71S1LG1FA/1U71S1LR1FA</strong> kasseta konditsioneri <strong data-start=\"151\" data-end=\"218\">katta ofislar, restoranlar, savdo markazlari va biznes binolari</strong> uchun <strong data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"244\">mukammal yechim</strong> hisoblanadi. <strong data-start=\"258\" data-end=\"340\">Kompakt dizayni, inverter texnologiyasi va to‘rt yo‘nalishli havo oqimi tizimi</strong> tufayli xona ichida <strong data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"396\">bir tekis va qulay mikroiqlimni</strong> ta’minlaydi.</p>",
   "format": "full_html",
   "processed": "<h3 data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"93\"><strong data-start=\"4\" data-end=\"91\">Haier AB71S1LG1FA/1U71S1LR1FA – Tijorat binolari uchun kuchli kasseta konditsioneri</strong></h3><p data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"411\"><strong data-start=\"95\" data-end=\"128\">Haier AB71S1LG1FA/1U71S1LR1FA</strong> kasseta konditsioneri <strong data-start=\"151\" data-end=\"218\">katta ofislar, restoranlar, savdo markazlari va biznes binolari</strong> uchun <strong data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"244\">mukammal yechim</strong> hisoblanadi. <strong data-start=\"258\" data-end=\"340\">Kompakt dizayni, inverter texnologiyasi va to‘rt yo‘nalishli havo oqimi tizimi</strong> tufayli xona ichida <strong data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"396\">bir tekis va qulay mikroiqlimni</strong> ta’minlaydi.</p>"
  },
  "field_opisanie_tovara_2": {
   "value": "<p><strong data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"482\">Invertor texnologiyasi</strong> – energiya tejamkorligi va uzoq muddatli ishlashni ta’minlaydi.<br><strong data-start=\"551\" data-end=\"583\">To‘rt yo‘nalishli havo oqimi</strong> – havo haroratining bir tekis taqsimlanishini ta’minlab, skvozyatning oldini oladi.<br><strong data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"710\">Energiya samaradorligi – A++ klass</strong> – elektr energiyasini tejaydi va foydalanish xarajatlarini kamaytiradi.<br><strong data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"805\">R32 sovutgichi</strong> – ekologik xavfsiz va yuqori samaradorlikka ega.<br><strong data-start=\"859\" data-end=\"888\">Tinch ishlash (30 dB dan)</strong> – ortiqcha shovqinsiz qulay foydalanish.<br><strong data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"968\">O‘z-o‘zini tozalash funksiyasi</strong> – mog‘or va bakteriyalar paydo bo‘lishining oldini oladi.<br><strong data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1073\">Moslashuvchan boshqarish imkoniyatlari</strong> – to‘plamda simsiz pult bor, qo‘shimcha simli pult ulash mumkin.<br><strong data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1168\">24/7 rejimida ishlash</strong> – tijorat binolari uchun mukammal variant.</p>",
   "format": "full_html",
